					<![CDATA[
						 <p>All in all a great tale,but here's a nitpick.</p> <blockquote> <p>Copper and bronze content</p> </blockquote> <p>Bronze is an alloy made mostly of copper. Maybe replace it with &quot;Copper and tin content&quot;?</p> <p>UPD: Another nitpick. It's taiga outside in one place, and tundra in another. Since these are different biomes, some uniformity is necessary.</p> 
				 	]]>
